    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\npick\n\n### Description\n\nI have recently switched from telescope to pick. I miss Jumplist Picker. It seems very useful for quick navigation.\r\n\r\nDevelopers of telescope uses ``vim.fn.getjumplist()``. Can it be implemented in pick or extra plugins?",
